&_nc_oc=Adoiv8RU6IgsZB9EQ_ETN64XJZUiP9NZbXberHWnauuqYKETVBCLA41Gdrc2GG40Wzg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRfqRvSEPnk4WUEzJdMDC5yBBeegaj7HdQpGvPy1pqLIw&oe=6AEB4C3E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yjBXFqCSsGIQ7kNvwG43-pX&_nc_oc=AdqV_B9fmboyd5-265XU-556q0RLxjitIttAO32HwQK4TeroCIdVw8e1JYk5l7tdjJw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRW1Xq-JqHtEkvBdnluQPZgXXEER9wcq5xjCxye15I9zQ&oe=6AEB5D3C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HD3noZPrE-gQ7kNvwGI8RoP&_nc_oc=Adq0v_sAdixHxep4i-jgIT-rUgzLWHoSJCoTiRlVvFXVP-auygu9UWH9nT2N3dRFtNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQd4ln5478eSA0dLY3T2GZpt45oU72cqxY71vjZTNMkfg&oe=6AEB4387"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5QI6YfZ8QDYQ7kNvwFSob8f&_nc_oc=Adqfd7OorgjvIYCk7R1uxPBkIZz2UwKRhOBIOnMsHwIaO58MJGUDqwsXKd60CrYfjOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSeojaCKPExkXY4Fc6rAYMO-3nguJA_Br1tNoKxs8wE8Q&oe=6AEB2F55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sQojeLeksSUQ7kNvwEsVCgV&_nc_oc=AdqdGStAz1zp1oI-EsVWhtbsACMJG04YzhG3Kk_NvokSMxjp8udJ1ropoorJZ18udDc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQpY6pgGgrIQghUeuM4F547u6WVvUdpXZ-HrnF_9ze3xQ&oe=6AEB3BE4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.